sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student (web UI)
    actor TU as Tutor (web UI)
    participant G as API Gateway (Traefik)
    participant A as Auth
    participant B as Booking
    participant W as Wallet
    participant Q as RabbitMQ
    participant N as Notification

    Note over S,N: REST = solid arrow, gRPC = labelled "gRPC", event = labelled "AMQP", local DB step = note box

    rect rgb(255, 236, 236)
    Note over B,N: Phase 1 · Meeting link is provisioned (after the booking was confirmed, UC-03)
    Note over B: Background worker (every 2 s) finds CONFIRMED bookings<br/>with meeting PROVISIONING. The meeting provider is simulated inside Booking.
    Note over B: Local DB transaction (PostgreSQL booking_db):<br/>meeting READY, generated link saved,<br/>outbox row booking.meeting-updated (state only, never the URL)
    B-)Q: AMQP publish booking.meeting-updated
    Q-)N: AMQP deliver event
    Note over N: Notify the student (simulated email and push)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 244, 230)
    Note over S,B: Phase 2 · Join the lesson
    S->>G: REST GET /api/bookings/{id}
    G->>A: REST forward-auth: verify session, account state, capability
    A-->>G: signed actor assertion (60 s, RS256)
    G->>B: REST request + actor assertion + gateway credential
    B-->>S: 200 booking with meeting.effectiveUrl, canJoin = true
    Note over S: Student opens the room at the meeting provider (outside the system)
    opt Tutor prefers their own room (until the scheduled end)
        TU->>G: REST PATCH /api/bookings/{id}/meeting-link (If-Match, Idempotency-Key)
        G->>B: REST after forward-auth (same as steps 4 to 6)
        B-->>TU: 200 custom link saved, booking.meeting-updated queued
    end
    Note over B: After the lesson ends the meeting view becomes CLOSED:<br/>no link, canJoin = false
    end

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over TU,B: Phase 3 · Tutor confirms completion (at or after the scheduled end)
    TU->>G: REST POST /api/bookings/{id}/confirm-completion (If-Match, Idempotency-Key)
    G->>B: REST after forward-auth (same as steps 4 to 6)
    alt Lesson ended and booking CONFIRMED with no pending action
        Note over B: One local DB transaction: status COMPLETED, tutor_confirmed_at = now,<br/>completion_handoffs row (saved Wallet command), outbox row booking.completed
        B-->>TU: 200 booking COMPLETED
    else Too early, not the assigned tutor, or cancelled
        B-->>TU: 409 LESSON_NOT_ENDED or BOOKING_NOT_CONFIRMED, 403 TUTOR_ONLY
    end
    B-)Q: AMQP publish booking.completed (student and tutor)
    Q-)N: AMQP deliver event, notify both people
    Note over B: Review is now allowed: gRPC ReviewEligibility returns eligible when status is COMPLETED (UC-08)
    end

    rect rgb(243, 235, 255)
    Note over B,W: Phase 4 · Financial handoff to Wallet (asynchronous, retried)
    B->>W: gRPC RecordLessonCompletion (saved command, original tutorConfirmedAt)
    alt Wallet answers
        Note over W: Local DB transaction (PostgreSQL wallet_db):<br/>row lock on the booking record, platform fee,<br/>pending tutor earning, clearing_due_at = confirmed time + 24 h
        W-->>B: 200 record COMPLETED, completion_handoffs row DONE
    else Wallet down or timeout
        Note over B,W: Worker repeats the same command with backoff.<br/>The original confirmation time is never replaced by the retry time.
    end
    end

    rect rgb(235, 255, 240)
    Note over W,N: Phase 5 · Earnings clearing (Wallet worker, every 30 s)
    Note over W: After clearing_due_at, one local DB transaction under the same row lock:<br/>skip if a dispute is held or a refund removed the earning,<br/>otherwise ledger LESSON_EARNING credit to the tutor wallet, record SETTLED,<br/>outbox row wallet.earning-cleared
    W-)Q: AMQP publish wallet.earning-cleared
    Q-)N: AMQP deliver event
    Note over N: Notify the tutor that earnings are available (payout is UC-07)
    end
